# Keeps the build context (src/TotallyHotArcRouter/Dockerfile's ". " context, from the repo root) small
# and avoids ever COPYing local build output, IDE state, or working-tree secrets into an image layer.
# "**/.vs/" (not a bare ".vs/", which only matches at the context root) matters for real: a bare pattern
# missed "src/.vs/" during this phase's own `podman build` verification, and Visual Studio's .vs/ holds
# index files the build container's user has no permission to even read, failing the COPY outright.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
.git/
.vscode/
docs/
*.md
**/*.pubxml
**/appsettings.local.json
